    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Kittenship Care is a cozy life-sim where you nurture, train, and play with adorable kittens. Create a purr-fect space and keep your furry friends happy in a relaxing, interactive sandbox. No stress\u2014just whiskers, cuddles, and kitten fun!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3597770/extras/752f1f410530effd5c547caf55ed7073.avif?t=1754627476\" width=738 height=223 /></span>Take in adorable kittens, care for their needs, and help them find the perfect home. Each kitten has its own personality - bond with them and ensure they're happy and healthy before they move on to a loving family.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3597770/extras/7af9d96b1395a3e3898d54ecbeb0c30c.poster.avif?t=1754627476\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3597770/extras/7af9d96b1395a3e3898d54ecbeb0c30c.webm?t=1754627476\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3597770/extras/7af9d96b1395a3e3898d54ecbeb0c30c.mp4?t=1754627476\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3597770/extras/951909af2bd8296d8640abc0a04fb351.avif?t=1754627476\" width=738 height=223 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pet them, play with them, and shower them with affection! Keep your kittens happy and healthy by giving them all the love and care they deserve.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3597770/extras/d78467ca6bb80edf305b6a58be6797fe.poster.avif?t=1754627476\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3597770/extras/d78467ca6bb80edf305b6a58be6797fe.webm?t=1754627476\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3597770/extras/d78467ca6bb80edf305b6a58be6797fe.mp4?t=1754627476\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3597770/extras/d17025cb5e64403e21145f6e831ee7d8.avif?t=1754627476\" width=738 height=223 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create a cozy space that feels like home for both you and your kittens! Decorate, rearrange, and make it your own while ensuring your furry friends have everything they need.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3597770/extras/3d835a9e9d549b53c404ced5361a4807.poster.avif?t=1754627476\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3597770/extras/3d835a9e9d549b53c404ced5361a4807.webm?t=1754627476\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3597770/extras/3d835a9e9d549b53c404ced5361a4807.mp4?t=1754627476\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3597770/extras/33d6de25ad2da8e938f9468db4fb3580.avif?t=1754627476\" width=738 height=223 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Watch your cats grow and thrive before sending them off to their forever home. Knowing they'll be loved and cared for makes every goodbye a little sweeter.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3597770/extras/ec83cc1080636c3a8eaf8a55abe9b9ae.poster.avif?t=1754627476\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3597770/extras/ec83cc1080636c3a8eaf8a55abe9b9ae.webm?t=1754627476\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3597770/extras/ec83cc1080636c3a8eaf8a55abe9b9ae.mp4?t=1754627476\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3597770/extras/49499abbf002b300177985e7d8362f95.avif?t=1754627476\" width=738 height=223 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Adopt &amp; Care for Kittens</strong> \u2013 Choose from a variety of kittens and tend to their needs in a cozy, interactive environment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Arrange &amp; Decorate Your Space</strong> \u2013 Place furniture and design your space to create the perfect home for your furry friends.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Meet Their Needs</strong> \u2013 Keep your kittens happy by providing food, water, and a comfortable place to rest.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Expand Your Home</strong> \u2013 With each successful adoption, unlock new rooms to build out and customize your ever-growing cozy space.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Relaxing &amp; Cozy Atmosphere</strong> \u2013 Enjoy a soothing gameplay experience with charming visuals and ambient sounds.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Kittenship Care is a cozy life-sim where you nurture, train, and play with adorable kittens. Create a purr-fect space and keep your furry friends happy in a relaxing, interactive sandbox. No stress\u2014just whiskers, cuddles, and kitten fun!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3597770/extras/752f1f410530effd5c547caf55ed7073.avif?t=1754627476\" width=738 height=223 /></span>Take in adorable kittens, care for their needs, and help them find the perfect home. Each kitten has its own personality - bond with them and ensure they're happy and healthy before they move on to a loving family.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3597770/extras/7af9d96b1395a3e3898d54ecbeb0c30c.poster.avif?t=1754627476\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3597770/extras/7af9d96b1395a3e3898d54ecbeb0c30c.webm?t=1754627476\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3597770/extras/7af9d96b1395a3e3898d54ecbeb0c30c.mp4?t=1754627476\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3597770/extras/951909af2bd8296d8640abc0a04fb351.avif?t=1754627476\" width=738 height=223 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pet them, play with them, and shower them with affection! Keep your kittens happy and healthy by giving them all the love and care they deserve.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://share