loved and cared for makes every goodbye a little sweeter.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3597770/extras/ec83cc1080636c3a8eaf8a55abe9b9ae.poster.avif?t=1754627476\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3597770/extras/ec83cc1080636c3a8eaf8a55abe9b9ae.webm?t=1754627476\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3597770/extras/ec83cc1080636c3a8eaf8a55abe9b9ae.mp4?t=1754627476\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3597770/extras/49499abbf002b300177985e7d8362f95.avif?t=1754627476\" width=738 height=223 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Adopt &amp; Care for Kittens</strong> \u2013 Choose from a variety of kittens and tend to their needs in a cozy, interactive environment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Arrange &amp; Decorate Your Space</strong> \u2013 Place furniture and design your space to create the perfect home for your furry friends.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Meet Their Needs</strong> \u2013 Keep your kittens happy by providing food, water, and a comfortable place to rest.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Expand Your Home</strong> \u2013 With each successful adoption, unlock new rooms to build out and customize your ever-growing cozy space.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Relaxing &amp; Cozy Atmosphere</strong> \u2013 Enjoy a soothing gameplay experience with charming visuals and ambient sounds.</p>",
